  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound elbow macaroni",
    "4 pounds Cheddar cheese, sliced",
    "1.5 cups milk",
    "5 eggs, or more to taste",
    "1 tablespoon yellow mustard",
    "ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6XVeuWyTBZsWRp74Qu77VrtyY9E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256033-grandmas-southern-mac-and-cheese-VAT-005-step-01-370a6254eb2b44f89898ab5341ad7825.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256033/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook elbow macaroni in the boiling water, stirring occasionally until tender yet firm to the bite, 8 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y_NLeM-ydsha6yALPXXJqxiLsII=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256033-grandmas-southern-mac-and-cheese-VAT-006-step-02-01drainedpasta-f2bae033212b415db395c6fa0831a903.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256033/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer some of the macaroni in a 5-quart baking dish; top with a layer of Cheddar cheese. Continue layering macaroni and Cheddar cheese into the dish, ending with a Cheddar cheese layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hkhxKZed3FVmkjY2NvMF1MUDDXg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256033-grandmas-southern-mac-and-cheese-VAT-007-step-03-d9821ccf15d84c52bd97ba018bcf3d29.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256033/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat milk, eggs, and mustard together in a bowl; pour over macaroni mixture, ensuring milk mixture gets to all of the macaroni.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3CSazwMYsgGos4_QM0UlfmYjtlQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256033-grandmas-southern-mac-and-cheese-VAT-008-step-04-01pouringaction-4fdf08ce7d684714b59037608f18f884.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256033/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cheese is melted and just before cheese around the sides gets crisp, 20 to 25 minutes. Season with black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pMzzziA7nN6meRStG5sGbJCwfVM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256033-grandmas-southern-mac-and-cheese-VAT-009-step-05-9cd3ce8fbc0a4f5a92a0c4a70bc51323.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256033/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_2UfiCk6j1LGiZZLfOBOPS3lEwU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256033-grandmas-southern-mac-and-cheese-VAT-003-4x3-8aefa9b1709b4185b992e7fea1036ef0.jpg"
